# 4-escalator.trk -- "Escalator", skylight track 4, 64 BPM, 16 rows per bar.
# Written in G (the album's notation); the tape speed on the pitch bus drops
# it ~7 semitones, so it sounds a fifth down (~C / the minor turn on A).
#   intro 8 | build 8 | full 16 | lights out 20 | outro 4 = 56 bars
# The minor turn: Em9 | Cmaj7 | Am9 | Bm7, one bar each.

track kick  note              # 1
track rim   note vel          # 2
track hat   note vel          # 3
track keys  note cva cvb cvd  # 4  four e-piano tones (no roots: the bass has them)
track bass  note vel          # 5  written an octave up (see the album README)
track lead  note vel          # 6  the trumpet

# ---------------- harmony ----------------
pattern harm 4x16 keys
1:00 | G3  B3  D4  Fs4       # Em9 (3 5 7 9)
2:00 | G3  B3  C4  E4        # Cmaj7
3:00 | B3  C4  E4  G4        # Am9 (9 3 5 7)
4:00 | A3  B3  D4  Fs4       # Bm7

# ---------------- bass: roots, long and low ----------------
pattern bass 4x16 bass
1:00 | E2:12 .85
1:12 | E2:4  .6
2:00 | C3:14 .8
3:00 | A2:12 .8
3:12 | A2:4  .55
4:00 | B2:12 .8
4:12 | Fs2:4 .6

# ---------------- drums: sparse half-time, a rimshot on 3 ----------------
pattern d_build 16 kick rim
lane kick  x... .... .... ....
lane rim   .... .... 6... ....

pattern d_full 16 kick rim hat
lane kick  x... .... ..x. ....
lane rim   .... .... 7... ...2
lane hat   ..2. ..3. ..2. ..3.

# ---------------- the trumpet: the jingle's first bar at half speed ----------------
# The jingle (README) bar 1 is D5:4 B4:2 G4:2 A4:6 B4:2; here every length is
# doubled, so it fills two bars. The second statement does not climb back:
# it falls to E, the minor tonic -- the turn.
pattern lead 8x16 lead
1:00 | D5:8  .8
1:08 | B4:4  .7
1:12 | G4:4  .65
2:00 | A4:12 .75
2:12 | B4:4  .6
5:00 | D5:8  .75
5:08 | B4:4  .65
5:12 | G4:4  .6
6:00 | E4:16 .7

# ---------------- form ----------------
section intro harm
section build harm+bass+d_build
section full  lead+harm+bass+d_full
section out   lead+harm+bass+d_full

order intro*2
order build*2
order full*2
order out*3
